(`dropSessionStructure3 → s0.readReg64 .x30`) and Stage P4 (`+0x3588` and `+0x550 → s0.readReg64 .x30`),
collapsing `sessionStateAt` and `prevVecAt [enc]` into `memRegion (coroPtr + 0xe0#64) 368`.
